WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:03.169
- I'll never forget, like
before we took one vote,

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:04.371
I won't say who,

00:00:04.371 --> 00:00:07.307 align:start size:88% position:13%
but one of their leaders
of this 20 stood up,

00:00:07.307 --> 00:00:08.641
and McCarthy asked him like,

00:00:08.641 --> 00:00:10.210
"What else do you guys want?

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:12.178 align:start size:97% position:3%
Like, let's just settle
this before we go out there

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:13.346
and look like fools.

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:15.849
What else can we do for you?"

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:18.718
And he just couldn't answer
it in front of everyone.

00:00:18.718 --> 00:00:20.186
That was a really
frustrating moment.

00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:22.756 align:start size:97% position:3%
So that's actually where
all the animosity came from,

00:00:22.756 --> 00:00:25.158
because it felt like
it was just for show.

00:00:25.158 --> 00:00:27.827
(pensive music)

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:33.666
- All right, I'm Dave Rubin,

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:36.503
and yes, this is a different set

00:00:36.503 --> 00:00:38.371
because we are in the swamp.

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:41.007
That's right, we are
in Washington D.C.

00:00:41.007 --> 00:00:42.776
and joining me across the table

00:00:42.776 --> 00:00:46.046 align:start size:88% position:13%
is a former Navy Seal
and now a US congressman

00:00:46.046 --> 00:00:49.115 align:start size:84% position:16%
representing Texas'
2nd District.

00:00:49.115 --> 00:00:51.251 align:start size:94% position:6%
Dan Crenshaw, welcome back
to "The Rubin Report."

00:00:51.251 --> 00:00:52.318
- Great to be here.

00:00:52.318 --> 00:00:53.586 align:start size:88% position:13%
- In this small bunker-
- I know.

00:00:53.586 --> 00:00:55.622
- That we are in here
in Washington D.C.

00:00:55.622 --> 00:00:57.123 align:start size:88% position:13%
- Everything's a little
smaller out here,

00:00:57.123 --> 00:00:58.758
you know, it's compact.

00:00:58.758 --> 00:01:00.427
But welcome, glad
you're out here.

00:01:00.427 --> 00:01:01.928
- I am glad to be here.

00:01:01.928 --> 00:01:03.396 align:start size:94% position:6%
You just got in from Texas
like seven minutes ago.

00:01:03.396 --> 00:01:04.864 align:start size:94% position:6%
- Yeah, yeah, yeah, I
just flew in this morning.

00:01:04.864 --> 00:01:06.099
- How are you feeling?

00:01:06.099 --> 00:01:07.333
Do need a moment to
collect yourself?

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:08.268
- I'm waiting for the
Sudafed to kick in.

00:01:08.268 --> 00:01:09.402
That's what I'm waiting for,

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:11.204 align:start size:84% position:16%
if I'm being
particularly honest.

00:01:11.204 --> 00:01:13.773 align:start size:84% position:16%
- So this is that
you have like COVID 7

00:01:13.773 --> 00:01:15.442 align:start size:84% position:16%
that you're bringing
to the Capitol?

00:01:15.442 --> 00:01:17.110
It must be, I don't know.

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:20.246 align:start size:97% position:3%
I think it's just allergies
got into, you know,

00:01:20.246 --> 00:01:21.681
you know how it is. I'm fine.

00:01:21.681 --> 00:01:23.817
We'll work through it.
- I guess we shall see.

00:01:23.817 --> 00:01:25.952
So I said to you
right when you...

00:01:25.952 --> 00:01:27.120
You just walked in
two seconds ago,

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:28.521 align:start size:88% position:13%
