what goes on here on the Hill?

00:03:14.661 --> 00:03:15.895
Yeah, yeah, to an extent.

00:03:15.895 --> 00:03:18.164
I mean, you know, I'll
give you an example.

00:03:18.164 --> 00:03:20.466
We're in E&amp;C, Energy
and Commerce Committee,

00:03:20.466 --> 00:03:21.701
