00:03:32.879 --> 00:03:36.115 align:start size:88% position:13%
So that should be
pretty plain and simple.

00:03:36.115 --> 00:03:37.584 align:start size:84% position:16%
By the way, it's all-
- Analogs,

00:03:37.584 --> 00:03:39.452 align:start size:97% position:3%
this is like stuff that
basically acts like fentanyl

00:03:39.452 --> 00:03:40.987 align:start size:72% position:28%
or something?
