basic makeup and outcome.

00:03:47.594 --> 00:03:49.762 align:start size:97% position:3%
I'm probably getting that
somewhat scientifically wrong.

00:03:49.762 --> 00:03:51.564
- It's bad stuff,
fentanyl, really.

00:03:51.564 --> 00:03:53.132
- But legally speaking,
like you need to do it

00:03:53.132 --> 00:03:55.868
so we can go after these
dealers in a cohesive way,

00:03:55.868 --> 00:03:57.604
which is way that's not
happening right now.

00:03:57.604 --> 00:04:02.442
Prosecutors have a really
hard time prosecuting,

00:04:02.442 --> 00:04:04.911 align:start size:94% position:6%
not even just fentanyl,
but like fentanyl analogs,

00:04:04.911 --> 00:04:07.113
something slightly different
that does the exact same thing.

00:04:07.113 --> 00:04:08.314
- [Dave] Got it.

00:04:08.314 --> 00:04:09.882
- I mean, marijuana's
a Schedule I drug.

00:04:09.882 --> 00:04:11.618 align:start size:97% position:3%
We can debate that
