00:04:23.596 --> 00:04:25.798 align:start size:97% position:3%
but the point is, it's really
not that controversial,

00:04:25.798 --> 00:04:29.402 align:start size:97% position:3%
and fentanyl is hurting
everyone across the country.

00:04:29.402 --> 00:04:33.039 align:start size:97% position:3%
I think two Democrats maybe
